  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8d71c9d5-523b-48cc-8c77-a7af751dc0be.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"98\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d427b741-41fb-46a1-83ce-63f9fcaaf87c.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7W0LUHevl8s\" width=\"830\" height=\"465\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_73f6453a-967e-4aad-86e4-6ff80aaaae07.png\" alt=\"統御工具\" width=\"343\" height=\"71\"></p><ul>\n<li>左鍵 = 下一章</li>\n<li>右鍵 = 上一章</li>\n<li>左鍵+中鍵 = 下一本書</li>\n<li>右鍵+中鍵 = 上一本書</li>\n<li>滑鼠按鍵4和5也能用來翻閱書籍</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b16dc457-3f0b-4d97-936a-d38dd7acba3b.png\" alt=\"另類統御\" width=\"343\" height=\"71\"></p><ul>\n<li>右鍵開啟介面</li>\n<li>右鍵可將特定（原版遊戲）生物治療回原形</li>\n<li>攻擊怪物會灼燒其肉體。若怪物具有火焰抗性，則造成額外傷害。也會根據最大生命值造成小部分傷害</li>\n<li>攻擊非怪物生物則會治療它們</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_faa92244-6f2c-497f-9017-42ddd8c91aeb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"343\" height=\"71\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_53a9e439-96ed-4420-aaef-403027e639bb.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"322\" height=\"153\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_40a9e9f8-dbb0-4b5a-971c-1b5af86a53e9.png\" alt=\"創作者\" width=\"343\" height=\"71\"></p><ul>\n<li>Ronald L. Conte Jr - CPDV聖經的創作者 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.sacredbible.org%252fcatholic%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.sacredbible.org/catholic/</a></li>\n<li>Starbound - 書籍材質的原始基礎</li>\n<li>Freef - 程式編寫與重新材質化</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7f3e8227-c0ec-4797-9616-f58adf83de87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"343\" height=\"71\"></p><p>想看看我為其他遊戲製作的模組嗎？點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinktr.ee%252fcatholicfreef\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡！</a></p><p>也可於<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fthe-bible\" rel=\"nofollow\">modrinth</a>取得</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bd313168-72e4-4dc9-8837-bda71e2c17fa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
